      "id": "a33dae0cda0efb8ed8e2",
      "title_original": "MORE OIL IS LEAVING THE PERSIAN GULF THAN BEFORE THE WAR\nMiddle East oil exports exceeded prewar levels in the week through October 18, according to Kpler.\nA U.S.-protected shipping system is keeping tankers moving despite continued attacks in the Strait of Hormuz.\nYet oil prices remain elevated...",
      "title_ko": "Kpler에 따르면 전쟁 전보다 더 많은 석유가 페르시아만에서 빠져나오고 있습니다. 중동 석유 수출량이 10월 18일까지 일주일 동안 전쟁 전 수준을 초과했다고 합니다. 미국이 보호하는 해운 시스템은 호르무즈 해협에서 계속되는 공격에도 불구하고 유조선을 계속 움직이게 하고 있습니다. 그래도 기름값은 계속 오르는데..",
      "description": "MORE OIL IS LEAVING THE PERSIAN GULF THAN BEFORE THE WAR\nMiddle East oil exports exceeded prewar levels in the week through October 18, according to Kpler.\nA U.S.-protected shipping system is keeping tankers moving despite continued attacks in the Strait of Hormuz.\nYet oil prices remain elevated as shipping costs surge, inventories tighten and traders fear renewed escalation.\n( @WalterBloomberg )",
      "source": "Walter Bloomberg",
